15 0 obj
<< /A 44 0 R /Alt (Panel A displays photographs of spleens and lymph nodes from wild type, DKO-moderate, and DKO-severe mice, showing progressive enlargement. Panel B is a scatter plot quantifying cell numbers of the spleen and lymph nodes across groups. Panel C is a bar graph displaying the gender distribution of moderate and severe DKO mice. Panels D\205H comprise scatter plots quantifying immune cell frequencies and absolute numbers, showing significant differences among groups, with statistical significance indicated. Panels I and J contain flow cytometry dot plots and accompanying scatter plots, comparing the percentage of naïve CD4+ and CD8+ T cells among groups, with numerical gates marked and statistical results indicated.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 30 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
16 0 obj
<< /A 45 0 R /Alt (Panel A shows a heatmap comparing gene expression clusters between wild-type, DKO-moderate, and DKO-severe groups, highlighting key genes and changes in Z-scores. Panel B presents flow cytometry contour plots for CD4+ FOXP3+ and CD4+ FOXP3- cells across wild-type, DKO-moderate, and DKO-severe groups, gated for PD-1 and CXCR5. Panel C displays dot plots quantifying the percentage and absolute numbers of PD-1+ CXCR5+ cells in each group, indicating statistical significance. Panel D presents histograms comparing BCL-6 and ICOS expression in FOXP3+ and FOXP3- subpopulations of PD-1+ CXCR5+ and PD-1- CXCR5- cells from the DKO-severe group.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 31 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
17 0 obj
<< /A 46 0 R /Alt (Panel A shows a UMAP plot with colored clusters labeled 0 to 19, representing distinct immune cell populations by type, genotype, and cluster identity. Panel B contains four UMAP plots: Cd4 and Cd8a gene expression across cells, and cell distributions for WT \(blue\) and DKO-severe \(red\) genotypes, highlighting differing cluster abundances. Panel C shows a heatmap of gene expression profiles across clusters for various immune genes, organized by functional group and colored to match the cluster legend above.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 32 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
18 0 obj
<< /A 47 0 R /Alt (Flow cytometry plots \(A, B\) show gating strategies and proportions of neutrophils and plasma cells in the spleen and lymph nodes from WT, DKO-moderate, and DKO-severe mouse. Dot plots \(C, D\) quantify neutrophil and plasma cell percentages and absolute numbers, indicating significant increases in DKO-severe. Immunofluorescence images \(E, F\) display spleen architecture and cellular markers, highlighting altered lymphoid organization and increased plasma cells in DKO-severe. Panel G presents bar graphs quantifying CD4+ICOS+FOXP3\205 cells and plasma cell numbers by genotype, with elevated counts in DKO-severe mice.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 34 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
19 0 obj
<< /A 48 0 R /Alt (Panel A shows dot plots comparing inflammatory scores in kidney, liver, lung, and pancreas among WT, DKO-Moderate, and DKO-Severe groups, with statistical significance indicated. Panel B presents liver immunofluorescence images for Foxp3-Cre WT, DKO-moderate, and DKO-severe mice, showing cellular markers IRF4 \(red\), ICOS \(yellow\), B220 \(cyan\), CD3e \(green\), FOXP3 \(blue\), and CD31 \(magenta\) at different magnifications. Panel C contains bar graphs quantifying CD4+ CD3e+ ICOS+ FOXP3- cells and plasma cell numbers in liver across groups, with DKO-Severe exhibiting the highest cell numbers.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 36 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
20 0 obj
<< /A 49 0 R /Alt (Panel A displays genomic tracks for the Bcl6 gene and Panel B for the Foxo1 gene, each showing gene structure, DNA methylation \(5mC%\), CpG sites, RNA sequencing, transcription factor CTCF binding, and conservation scores. Tracks compare wildtype \(WT\) and double knockout \(DKO\) samples, visualize differences in methylation, indicate CpG distributions, and include RNA-seq and ChIP-seq signals for gene regions at different resolutions.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 37 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
